Z||000000||Haze_Performance||11-13-2001||02:30 AM||||I know Rodney makes one but I'm looking to save a little $$$<P>I've seen a few people here with this mod. Do you have any pics? How did you do it? What car is it from?<P>Every time I try a search, my computer will freeze up.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">   DAMN PUTER!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> <P>Thank You for the help.<BR>-Haze  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/goodlife.gif">   <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="purple">Goto Website - <A HREF="http://www.ClassicFiero.com" TARGET=_blank>Click Here</A> </FONT></FONT>||||reg||5
